      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "AFTER SUN (4) goes very well at the course and distance with two wins and a placing from three starts. Scored by 1.3 lengths last time (20.07) in a Grade 5 over 350m at Goulburn. Looks suited here and rates on top. TOPPER TENACIOUS (1) was below latest but prior to that a Grade 4 winner in quick time (20.94) at this track in a Grade 4. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. ROMANI LASS (2) has missed the frame at her last two but did run well three back when second (20.88) in a Grade 4 at this track. Has the ability and can find best this time. FUTURE REFERENCE (7) should bounce back after an unplaced effort here recently.",
